040010 Desc             ="Limits the injection quantity by the amount of air actually ingested by the engine. If 60 mg IQ is requested but the engine only gets 300 mg of air, that would result in an AFR of 5 which is obviously not good. This map allows you to compensate for that. Sometimes there are multiple maps, of which one is selected based on coolant temperature."
